---
// apps/frontend/site/src/lib/components/sections/meaningful_choices.astro
---

<section id="choices" class="scroll-mt-24 border-b border-border/70 bg-card/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-brand dark:text-brand-soft">
        02 / People &amp; consequences
      </p>
    </div>
    <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-4xl leading-[1.08] md:text-5xl">
      Not just a world to visit.<br>
      <em>A world to become part of.</em>
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-9 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
      <article id="residents" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">People with somewhere to be.</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Mara opens her shop in the morning and heads to the inn after work. She has a life beyond
          your conversation.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Routines. Relationships. Reasons to act. People respond to what they witness or learn—not
          everything you do in secret.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="border-l-2 border-ember pl-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Your choices leave a trace.</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Spare the bandits, and the night road may become unsafe. Mara stays home. Fewer travelers
          reach the inn.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Help restore safety, and everyday life can gradually return. A consequence should be a
          story you can change—not just a number on a screen.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-7 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Illustrative character vignette</p>
    <p class="mt-6 border-t border-border pt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      You describe the action. AI helps interpret and narrate it.
      <span class="text-foreground">The game’s rules determine what can happen.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
